OL,3,GNEWSACommunity orchard at risk from
OL,4,Aplans for new homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have criticised plans to
OL,7,Fbuild 160 new homes in a village
OL,8,Fbecause the build would result in the
OL,9,Fdestruction of an orchard.
OL,11,FDeveloper Pearce Construction
OL,12,F(Barnstaple) Ltd has proposed 48
OL,13,Faffordable homes in West Yelland, near
OL,14,FBarnstaple, in plans which would need
OL,15,Fthe community orchard to be removed for
OL,16,Faccess.
OL,18,FThe Lagoon View Community Orchard
OL,19,FAssociation said it "actively opposed"
OL,20,Fthe plans despite them showing a new
OL,21,Forchard would be created.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
