OL,3,GNEWSACommunity orchard at risk from
OL,4,Aplans for new homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Devon District Council said the
OL,7,Fapplication was in a consultation
OL,8,Fperiod and it would assess all planning
OL,9,Fconsiderations while balancing the
OL,10,Fapplication's "benefits and impacts."
